spec: S05-02, S05-04, S05-05, S05-14

Seeds the Actions the read-only `65-actions` cases look at: `act-plan` gets `approve` by @rowan
and then `send-back` by @scribe on v1 (last event wins), a v2 (which starts with no
Action), then `approve` by @scribe on v2; `act-none` has Versions but no Action. Merged
stdout+stderr; ids are random.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push act-plan.md -m "first draft"
act-plan	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan act act-plan approve --version 1
act-plan	v1	approve	by @rowan

$ annotary -p agent act act-plan send-back
act-plan	v1	send-back	by @scribe

$ annotary -p rowan push v2/act-plan.md --doc act-plan -m "skill file with the CLI"
act-plan	[..]	v2

$ annotary -p agent status act-plan
act-plan	[..]	v2	action:-	open:0	mentions-me:0	seq:[..]

$ annotary -p agent act act-plan approve --version 2
act-plan	v2	approve	by @scribe

$ annotary -p rowan push act-none.md
act-none	[..]	v1

```
